cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use sidereon in your work, please cite it."
title: "sidereon"
abstract: "A reference-validated GNSS and astrodynamics engine: single- and precise-point positioning (SPP/RTK/PPP), SGP4/SDP4 propagation, conjunction assessment, RINEX/RTCM/SP3/NTRIP data formats, RINEX quality control, and frame/time/atmosphere models, with native Rust, Python, C, WebAssembly, and Elixir interfaces over a single Rust core."
type: software
authors:
