    description: "Zenodo archive of sidereon 0.11.1"
repository-code: "https://github.com/neilberkman/sidereon"
url: "https://sidereon.dev"
license: MIT
version: "0.11.1"
date-released: "2026-07-03"
keywords:
  - GNSS
  - astrodynamics
  - SGP4
  - RINEX
  - RTCM
  - RTK
  - PPP
  - orbit-determination
  - quality-control
